OL,3,AWhite House removes cyber-security     
OL,4,Achief after series of tech outages     
OL,6,FThe top cyber-security official in the 
OL,7,FUS government is leaving his post after
OL,8,Fa little over a year in the job.       
OL,10,FWhite House National Cyber Director    
OL,11,FSean Cairncross was fired after losing 
OL,12,Fthe confidence of the White House chief
OL,13,Fof staff, Stephen Miller, according    
OL,14,FCBS, the BBC's US news partner. Asked  
OL,15,Fabout his removal on Friday, President 
OL,16,FDonald Trump said it was because he was
OL,17,Fnot "good enough".                     
OL,19,FHis firing comes after a string of tech
OL,20,Foutages which hit banking, air traffic 
OL,21,Fcontrol and other sectors.             
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
